  "limits": [
    "The protected guest disk and independent authority journal must survive both ordinary root-disk restores. Filesystem locking, durable exclusive creation and sync, OS randomness, and Ed25519 verification are trusted.",
    "The authority requires continuous, ordered QMP events from the same live emulator and exclusive coordination of operations that can stop it. A running VM alone cannot identify the completed ticket.",
    "The tests restore powered-off root disks. Rewinding live RAM, rolling back the independent records, or losing all terminal evidence is outside positive recovery. Loss of observation before certification keeps the tested pool closed."
  ]
